672
38:57.990 --> 38:58.940
Ow, uh...

673
38:58.940 --> 39:00.380
- Hey, get down. - Get down from there!

674
39:00.380 --> 39:01.370
- What? I... - Get down!

675
39:01.380 --> 39:02.360
- Get down! - Down, now!

676
39:02.360 --> 39:03.350
