688
39:14.910 --> 39:16.060
I'm not leaving.

689
39:16.060 --> 39:17.590
- I'm not leaving here. - Mister...

690
39:17.590 --> 39:19.580
- No, please, don't do it... - Don't... Don't resist.

691
39:19.580 --> 39:20.360
- Don't... - Don't resist. Come with us.

692
39:20.940 --> 39:22.250
